# The vendored parser's *.index.bin files store OFFSETS into the .ndjson text. Git
# rewriting line endings on checkout shifts every offset by one byte per preceding line
# and the parser then reads garbage - so these files must never be touched. (Seen as
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings when the language data was first committed.)
renderer/vendor/ee2/data/** -text
*.ndjson -text
*.bin binary
